% Grackle one-zone test: uniform static periodic gas box (all cells are the same one-zone problem).
% test_grackle_onezone.py overrides InitCondFile, OutputDir and GrackleDataFile per run (and adds the GALSF
% parameters for the METALS variants, which need GALSF to set the metallicity at start-up).
InitCondFile                       grackle_onezone_hot_ics
OutputDir                          output
TimeMax                            0.002
TimeBetSnapshot                    0.0002
TimeBetStatistics                  0.0002
BoxSize                            0.01
DesNumNgb                          32
MaxNumNgbDeviation                 0.1
MaxMemSize                         2000
UnitLength_in_cm                   3.085678e+21
UnitMass_in_g                      1.989e+43
UnitVelocity_in_cm_per_s           100000
MinGasTemp                         1
ErrTolIntAccuracy                  0.002
CourantFac                         0.1
MaxRMSDisplacementFac              0.1
ErrTolForceAcc                     0.0015
MaxSizeTimestep                    1e-6     % resolves the fast cooling transients (GIZMO calls Grackle once per hydro step)
ResubmitOn                         0
ResubmitCommand                    none
ErrTolTheta                        0.7
TreeDomainUpdateFrequency          0.5
GrackleDataFile                    CloudyData_UVB=HM2012_shielded.h5
